{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>MathPro 是專為 5 至 12 年級學生設計的完整數學助手，也適合任何想在一處獲得清晰、有條理的數學內容的人。它將 290 多個公式、互動式圖表、科學計算器與多種學習資源集中於同一應用程式，現正限時免費，原價 US $1.99。</p>\n\n<h2>整合數學工具與資源</h2>\n<p>MathPro 收錄 290 多個公式，分為基礎、代數、幾何、三角、微積分、統計等 12 個類別，每個公式均附清晰講解與逐步解答例題。另有 50 個互動式圖表、科學計算器、單位換算器、120 道分級測驗題、350 多個數學術語詞條及 20 條重要規則與定律，配合深色和淺色模式及 10 種語言，方便學生備考、做作業或複習。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-428-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-429-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-430-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-431-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-432-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-433-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：MathPro by EtemiDev</li>\n<li>應用類別：Education</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-13T14:59:42.764723+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":344,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}